This software automates calls to CSI ETABS via the CSI OAPI (COM interface).
It is a tool, not a licensed engineer. All analysis results, design outputs,
and code checks must be reviewed and sealed by a qualified structural engineer
of record before use in construction documents. The authors accept no
responsibility for designs produced with this software.

